{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>When you\u2019re busy, they keep moving with you.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf19 This is not a game that demands your attention</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat Paws Odyssey runs quietly while you use your computer.<br>Every keystroke and mouse click gives them energy to continue their journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/21cec6f787a41c12ba272303ce0cc84a.poster.avif?t=1770102681\" width=620 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/21cec6f787a41c12ba272303ce0cc84a.webm?t=1770102681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/21cec6f787a41c12ba272303ce0cc84a.mp4?t=1770102681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat.<br>No reflex tests.<br>No need to stay focused on the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You do your thing.<br>They do theirs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc3e Your everyday actions become their adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They travel across the world\u2014running, stopping, looking around.<br>Along the way, they collect all kinds of charming accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress them up however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/7406b0f42702f8109a1adcfde02b99b6.poster.avif?t=1770102681\" width=620 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/7406b0f42702f8109a1adcfde02b99b6.webm?t=1770102681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/7406b0f42702f8109a1adcfde02b99b6.mp4?t=1770102681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And sometimes,<br>when you\u2019re not paying attention,<br>they might even whisper to each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd0d Some companionship is quiet</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can stay connected with friends.<br>Even when you\u2019re each busy with your own lives,<br>your little companions move together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No interruptions.<br>No pressure to interact.<br>Just the feeling that<br><strong>someone else is there too.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/764523f6f121da0c2760f04043c34ec1.poster.avif?t=1770102681\" width=660 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/764523f6f121da0c2760f04043c34ec1.webm?t=1770102681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/764523f6f121da0c2760f04043c34ec1.mp4?t=1770102681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 Perfect for moments like these</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Late-night work sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coding, designing, studying</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listening to music while working</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you just don\u2019t want your desktop to feel empty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf81 Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/4382a74a7a842a782ab492d786fc71a2.poster.avif?t=1770102681\" width=620 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/4382a74a7a842a782ab492d786fc71a2.webm?t=1770102681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947470/extras/4382a74a7a842a782ab492d786fc71a2.mp4?t=1770102681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn keyboard and mouse activity into energy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat, no stress, runs alongside your daily tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple animals and cosmetic collections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online companion mode with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightweight and unobtrusive</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat Paws Odyssey isn\u2019t a game that takes your time\u2014 it stays with you while time passes.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"One Small Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3947470/479adb00957740b5b539a81cc25fd6f346b469d1.jpg"},{"name":"Pawstarter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3947470/4c89bbe95c3aad79939f12ce49c88c7b43e34ffa.jpg"},{"name":"Tiny Sprint","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3947470/8c5d6e51408278f3344a435f304f4844f104f654.jpg"},{"name":"Mini Marathon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3947470/58efd70827ad4abc44a272a4adcddb9fcbe8c004.jpg"},{"name":"World Pacer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/app